      "In the LQ factorization, $\\mathbf{U}^\\dagger\\mathbf{U} = Q_2 Q_2^\\top$, so $\\mathbf{G} = \\mathbf{Y}(I - Q_2 Q_2^\\top) = L_{11}Q_1^\\top$."
