      "Incorrect: By Kronecker rank properties (`ESI.pdf` p. 8 Problem 4b), $\\text{rank}(F) = \\text{rank}(\\mathbf{\\Phi}^\\top)\\text{rank}(I_{n+p}) = (n+p)\\text{rank}(\\mathbf{\\Phi})$, so $\\text{rank}(F) = (n+p)(n+m) \\iff \\text{rank}(\\mathbf{\\Phi}) = n+m$; uniqueness of $\\hat{\\theta}$ and $\\hat{\\Theta}$ are completely equivalent.",
