      "Incorrect: Because $y(t-1) = b_o u(t-2) + e(t-1)$ is uncorrelated with $v(t-1)$, $\\lambda_v$ drops out completely from $\\mathbb{E}[y(t-1)\\hat{u}(t-1)]$.",
