    "hint": "Here the scalar regressor is $\\varphi(t) = u(t-1) + u(t-2)$. Since $u(t)$ is white noise with variance $\\lambda_u = 2$, compute $\\mathbb{E}[(u(t-1) + u(t-2))^2] = 2\\lambda_u$ and substitute into $\\frac{\\sigma^2}{N \\cdot 2\\lambda_u}$.",
