    "prompt": "According to the large-sample frequency-domain variance approximation $\\text{Var}\\left(G(e^{i\\omega}; \\hat{\\theta})\\right) \\approx \\frac{n}{N} \\frac{\\lambda}{\\Phi_u(\\omega)}$ (for white noise variance $\\lambda$), increasing the model order $n$ decreases the variance of the estimated frequency function at all frequencies.",
