      "Because $\\mathbf{\\Phi}\\mathbf{\\Phi}^\\dagger$ and $\\mathbf{\\Phi}^\\dagger\\mathbf{\\Phi}$ have the same dimensions $(n+m) \\times (n+m)$ and are always equal.",
