      "It projects the rows of $\\mathbf{Y}$ onto the orthogonal complement of the row space of $\\mathbf{U}$, so $\\mathbf{U}\\Pi = 0$ and the input term $\\mathcal{T}_r \\mathbf{U}\\Pi$ is completely eliminated: $G = \\mathbf{Y}\\Pi = \\mathcal{O}_r X\\Pi + M\\Pi$.",
