    "explanation": "From `CL_SI.pdf` page 8 and `ESI.pdf` page 5:\nBy the Moore-Penrose property $\\mathbf{U}\\mathbf{U}^\\dagger\\mathbf{U} = \\mathbf{U}$, we have\n$$\\mathbf{U}\\Pi = \\mathbf{U}(I - \\mathbf{U}^\\dagger\\mathbf{U}) = \\mathbf{U} - \\mathbf{U}\\mathbf{U}^\\dagger\\mathbf{U} = 0.$$\nTherefore, multiplying $\\mathbf{Y} = \\mathcal{O}_r X + \\mathcal{T}_r \\mathbf{U} + M$ from the right by $\\Pi$ eliminates the unknown Toeplitz input term $\\mathcal{T}_r \\mathbf{U}$:\n$$G = \\mathbf{Y}\\Pi = \\mathcal{O}_r (X\\Pi) + M\\Pi,$$\nallowing us to estimate the range space of the extended observability matrix $\\mathcal{O}_r$."
