      "Incorrect: because the squared term $(\\theta_j - \\widehat{\\theta}_j^{\\text{LS}})^2$ has derivative $2(\\theta_j - \\widehat{\\theta}_j^{\\text{LS}})$ without a $1/2$ factor in front, the threshold is $\\lambda/2$, not $\\lambda$."
