    "prompt": "In Scenario 2 of Problem 4(b) (balancing the inverted pendulum around the upright position $\\theta \\approx \\pi$ using stabilizing feedback control), assume that you attempt to identify the system using a linear **ARX model**.\n\nWhat potential issues may arise from this approach? Discuss in relation to the inverted pendulum experiment and the limitations of linear ARX models.",
