      "Incorrect. Here $\\varphi(t) = \\begin{bmatrix} -y(t-1) \\\\ u(t-1) \\end{bmatrix}$ depends only on signals up to time $t-1$, which are uncorrelated with the white noise innovation $e(t)$, so there is no closed-loop bias.",
